  <History Date="23-05-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Capitalised and removed spaces from fixture name in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised classic pearl refs.  Changed cell mode to hidden." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour macro functions with variable ranges.  Increased wheel resolution." />
  <History Date="09-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved ring effect and ring speed into effect group" />
  <History Date="01-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed dimmer to intensity in HSI modes and linked to vdim for compatibility" />
  <History Date="01-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
